/&gt;This bullcrap, along with a long line of other Pro Libertate posts and websites dedicated to same, is the reason I stopped working in the legal profession two decades ago.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7523002643329887664/comments/default/4808475230952587119'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7523002643329887664/comments/default/4808475230952587119'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/prosecution-as-persecution-carol-asher.html?showComment=1447612345461#c4808475230952587119' title=''/><author><name>Ned</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/prosecution-as-persecution-carol-asher.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7523002643329887664' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7523002643329887664' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-502617647"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 15, 2015 at 11:32 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8788064826757475654</id><published>2012-12-29T07:56:59.829-07:00</published><updated>2012-12-29T07:56:59.829-07:00</updated><title type='text'>&amp;quot;Fully informed Jurors&amp;quot; are the state&amp;#3...</title><content type='html'>&amp;quot;Fully informed Jurors&amp;quot; are the state&amp;#39;s worst enemy.&lt;br /&gt;It infuriates prosecutors to have a bunch of uneducated&lt;br /&gt;bumpkins upset their best laid plans.&lt;br /&gt;Power to the People.&lt;br /&gt;Ms. Asher is a true American hero and has demonstrated&lt;br /&gt;how and why the state must answer to a higher authority&lt;br /&gt;(which it hates.)&lt;br /&gt;I have a King and his name is Jesus Christ; the state &lt;br /&gt;can either get in step or go to hell.&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7523002643329887664/comments/default/8788064826757475654'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7523002643329887664/comments/default/8788064826757475654'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/prosecution-as-persecution-carol-asher.html?showComment=1356793019829#c8788064826757475654' title=''/><author><name>Will Blalock</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/18121019056190783526</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='32' src='//lh5.googleusercontent.com/-XBGKRiOjJJQ/AAAAAAAAAAI/AAAAAAAAAB4/D30hxKlZizg/s512-c/photo.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/prosecution-as-persecution-carol-asher.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7523002643329887664' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7523002643329887664' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-832848697"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 29, 2012 at 7:56 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-80186361175325987</id><published>2012-12-29T03:18:02.665-07:00</published><updated>2012-12-29T03:18:02.665-07:00</updated><title type='text'>“I can’t take my orders merely from a judge, but a...</title><content type='html'>“I can’t take my orders merely from a judge, but am bound by a higher authority to render fair and just judgment according to the dictates of my own conscience in trying to protect the rights of the accused,” Asher explained. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;That is the perfect definition of what a juror should be thinking! &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;And it is the perfect explanation as  to why the jury system is so vital in the pursuit of justice.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;True justice is certainly not the goal of the amerikan gubment. No wonder they went after Carol Asher. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&amp;quot;...am bound by a higher authority...&amp;quot; - oh Carol you thought terrorist! How dare you think that there is any higher authority than The State.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;It is amazing to me that so many so-called liberty lovers are the first to try to get out of jury duty. (I turned off forever that great lover of The American Way Rush Limbaugh when he lambasted someone for not being smart enough to get out of jury duty.) &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;It is through the jury that we can best fight back against TPTB. But the jury must consist of intelligent, well informed, and moral people. You know, like Citizens of a Republic!&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Thanks, Will, for bringing to light Carol Asher.  I am not a Christian per se, and am certainly not Catholic but Carol Asher is a new found hero to me.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7523002643329887664/comments/default/80186361175325987'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7523002643329887664/comments/default/80186361175325987'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/prosecution-as-persecution-carol-asher.html?showComment=1356776282665#c80186361175325987' title=''/><author><name>whitebuffalo</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/prosecution-as-persecution-carol-asher.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7523002643329887664' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7523002643329887664' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1007481845"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 29, 2012 at 3:18 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1461533319861459119</id><published>2012-12-28T16:43:36.905-07:00</published><updated>2012-12-28T16:43:36.905-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Thanks again Will, for your thought provoking and ...</title><content type='html'>Thanks again Will, for your thought provoking and honorable posts... I am happy to see that much of your writing is being published on lewrockwell.com and other outlets... I wish you success and more exposure in the new year... You have earned it, my friend...</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7523002643329887664/comments/default/1461533319861459119'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7523002643329887664/comments/default/1461533319861459119'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/prosecution-as-persecution-carol-asher.html?showComment=1356738216905#c1461533319861459119' title=''/><author><name>Syntek99</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/prosecution-as-persecution-carol-asher.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7523002643329887664' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7523002643329887664' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-275438819"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 28, 2012 at 4:43 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-874552758291861860</id><published>2012-12-28T11:54:23.380-07:00</published><updated>2012-12-28T11:54:23.380-07:00</updated><title type='text'>I have no high moral principles, but why should I ...</title><content type='html'>&lt;i&gt; I have no high moral principles, but why should I be forced to validate their police state when all they say they want is a robot?&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;From what you write, I would say you have high moral principles.  The basics, at least, which 99% of America lacks.&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7523002643329887664/comments/default/874552758291861860'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7523002643329887664/comments/default/874552758291861860'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/prosecution-as-persecution-carol-asher.html?showComment=1356720863380#c874552758291861860' title=''/><author><name>JdL</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/prosecution-as-persecution-carol-asher.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7523002643329887664' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7523002643329887664' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1261066111"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 28, 2012 at 11:54 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-196648559740609672</id><published>2012-12-28T09:41:10.245-07:00</published><updated>2012-12-28T09:41:10.245-07:00</updated><title type='text'>I didn&amp;#39;t want to serve, but when threatened en...</title><content type='html'>I didn&amp;#39;t want to serve, but when threatened enough I turned up. Got to go through security screening fifty times. I started putting my hands on my head like a convict. Others started to as well. Some prissy little man started lecturing us, saying we weren&amp;#39;t under arrest. Seems like we had to make The System look good.&lt;br /&gt;I punished them. I tainted every jury pool by asking intelligent questions. I have no high moral principles, but why should I be forced to validate their police state when all they say they want is a robot? </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7523002643329887664/comments/default/196648559740609672'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7523002643329887664/comments/default/196648559740609672'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/prosecution-as-persecution-carol-asher.html?showComment=1356712870245#c196648559740609672' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/prosecution-as-persecution-carol-asher.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7523002643329887664' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7523002643329887664' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-607893904"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 28, 2012 at 9:41 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7374423068610902265</id><published>2012-12-28T08:30:01.917-07:00</published><updated>2012-12-28T08:30:01.917-07:00</updated><title type='text'>@Jerri Lynn Ward&#xa;&#xa;Excellent comment and I fully ag...</title><content type='html'>@Jerri Lynn Ward&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Excellent comment and I fully agree.  &lt;br /&gt;The last gasp of hope in our judicial process is the jury.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;As Grigg points out, legislatures are constantly seeking new&lt;br /&gt;ways to undermine &lt;b&gt;our&lt;/b&gt; juries with laws such as the &amp;quot;tell even if I don&amp;#39;t ask&amp;quot; &lt;br /&gt;law which serves only to enable Idaho courts to overturn verdicts (and jail jurors.)&lt;br /&gt;Other states however such as New Hampshire are going the other way by allowing&lt;br /&gt;defense attorneys to bolster juries by informing them of their right&lt;br /&gt;to judge not only the facts but the law as well (jury nullification.)&lt;br /&gt;Let&amp;#39;s hope every state follows New Hampshire&amp;#39;s example. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Many judges and prosecutors have forgotten the specific warnings given them by&lt;br /&gt;our Lord Jesus Christ and it would behoove them to get their sh*t straight. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;For judges who enjoy their position in the seat of Moses:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Luke 11:43&lt;br /&gt;&lt;b&gt;Woe unto you&lt;/b&gt;, Pharisees! for ye love the uppermost seats in the synagogues, &lt;br /&gt;and greetings in the markets.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;For prosecutors who enjoy abusing their office:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Luke 11:46&lt;br /&gt;And he said, &lt;b&gt;Woe unto you also&lt;/b&gt;, ye lawyers! for ye lade men with burdens grievous &lt;br /&gt;to be borne, and ye yourselves touch not the burdens with one of your fingers.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;As for cops who lie on the stand, you are going &lt;b&gt;straight to Hell&lt;/b&gt;:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Deuteronomy 5:20&lt;br /&gt;Neither shalt thou bear false witness against thy neighbour.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7523002643329887664/comments/default/7374423068610902265'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7523002643329887664/comments/default/7374423068610902265'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/prosecution-as-persecution-carol-asher.html?showComment=1356708601917#c7374423068610902265' title=''/><author><name>willb</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/prosecution-as-persecution-carol-asher.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7523002643329887664' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7523002643329887664' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-527594058"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 28, 2012 at 8:30 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8244199322509237946</id><published>2012-12-28T08:21:11.755-07:00</published><updated>2012-12-28T08:21:11.755-07:00</updated><title type='text'>I&amp;#39;m proud to say that I was one of a couple do...</title><content type='html'>I&amp;#39;m proud to say that I was one of a couple dozen people who were present to protest the railroading of Laura Kriho on March 7, 1997 (that&amp;#39;s the day Nieto imposed the obscene $1200 fine as punishment for her doing her duty as a citizen), but am ashamed to say that I hadn&amp;#39;t heard of the Carol Asher case until now. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Government thugs like Wasden, MacGregor, and Bradbury need to have their teeth pulled (the teeth that let them act as rampaging criminals in government clown suits with impunity, not necessarily their actual teeth), by whatever means are necessary.  I only hope it can be accomplished peacefully.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7523002643329887664/comments/default/8244199322509237946'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7523002643329887664/comments/default/8244199322509237946'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/prosecution-as-persecution-carol-asher.html?showComment=1356708071755#c8244199322509237946' title=''/><author><name>JdL</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/prosecution-as-persecution-carol-asher.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7523002643329887664' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7523002643329887664' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1261066111"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 28, 2012 at 8:21 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-124786092088084911</id><published>2012-12-28T03:26:46.715-07:00</published><updated>2012-12-28T03:26:46.715-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Once I saw jury duty as something to be avoided.  ...</title><content type='html'>Once I saw jury duty as something to be avoided.  Now I see it as a way to fling a glove into the face of power.  The Tree doth desperately need watering!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7523002643329887664/comments/default/124786092088084911'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7523002643329887664/comments/default/124786092088084911'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/prosecution-as-persecution-carol-asher.html?showComment=1356690406715#c124786092088084911' title=''/><author><name>GunRights4US</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/16830687524291663778</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='24' height='32' src='http://4.bp.blogspot.com/-mJt86fSKxNg/UA2XtfAnIXI/AAAAAAAABt4/nwBQeQ1S_kM/s220/DSCN0960%2B-%2BCopy.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/prosecution-as-persecution-carol-asher.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7523002643329887664' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7523002643329887664' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-2136382669"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 28, 2012 at 3:26 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4994637493456299996</id><published>2012-12-27T23:31:24.100-07:00</published><updated>2012-12-27T23:31:24.100-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Coprophagous? Really? You are worse than Buckley. ...</title><content type='html'>Coprophagous? Really? You are worse than Buckley. :-)&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;(But thanks - that was my new word for the day.) &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;LLAP</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7523002643329887664/comments/default/4994637493456299996'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7523002643329887664/comments/default/4994637493456299996'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/prosecution-as-persecution-carol-asher.html?showComment=1356676284100#c4994637493456299996' title=''/><author><name>Mister Spock</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/prosecution-as-persecution-carol-asher.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7523002643329887664' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7523002643329887664' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-324542627"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 27, 2012 at 11:31 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6673549402903389514</id><published>2012-12-27T20:24:44.039-07:00</published><updated>2012-12-27T20:24:44.039-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Don&amp;#39;t turn down jury duty.  I got on a jury ev...</title><content type='html'>Don&amp;#39;t turn down jury duty.  I got on a jury even though I&amp;#39;m a lawyer--which is really rare.  What&amp;#39;s even rarer is that it was a DUI case involving driving after smoking pot and I joined the majority of the panel in raising my hand when the prosecutor asked which among us supported legalizing pot.  They let me on and I was foreman.  The prosecution failed to prove its case which meant that I didn&amp;#39;t even have to argue nullification.  It failed because the cops got up on the stand and lied about how the guy was driving before the stop.  They also lied about the guy telling them that he had just had surgery on his ear (which caused balance problems) and that he would have problems with the sobriety test.  The defendant admitted smoking pot, but the cops failed to prove that it effected his driving (essential element).  They also lied.  The jury acquitted.  All them also agreed with me that most of us middle aged people couldn&amp;#39;t pass the sobriety test stone cold sober.  So, don&amp;#39;t try to get off juries.  Get on one and you will find that you will only have to argue a deficit of evidence and not nullification.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7523002643329887664/comments/default/6673549402903389514'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7523002643329887664/comments/default/6673549402903389514'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/prosecution-as-persecution-carol-asher.html?showComment=1356665084039#c6673549402903389514' title=''/><author><name>Jerri Lynn Ward</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/prosecution-as-persecution-carol-asher.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7523002643329887664' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7523002643329887664' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1107238947"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 27, 2012 at 8:24 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1281783063091519535</id><published>2012-12-27T13:32:47.728-07:00</published><updated>2012-12-27T13:32:47.728-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Sociopaths: this is the only word ,to use when des...</title><content type='html'>Sociopaths: this is the only word ,to use when describing All, and I do mean all!!! [Every one of them] for the brain dead educated reader. Attorneys at law, they practice, because the Law and justice are the last thing they know. To be a barred attorney ,you must learn to defend the guilty and convict the not guilty and think of it, only in regard to a job for money. A means to an end for you, Oh unless you can find a cause that will make you more money. To look as though you are helping undo wrongs that  you know the system is in place to bring about. You can make a real [good] name for yourself, under the guise of &amp;quot;helping&amp;quot; just look at the the ACLU.  We need to understand ALL lawyers are officers of the courts they work for, they are the new priesthood, and above all law this now has entered into all the public officials, arena ,as well welcome to, The New World Order</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7523002643329887664/comments/default/1281783063091519535'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7523002643329887664/comments/default/1281783063091519535'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/prosecution-as-persecution-carol-asher.html?showComment=1356640367728#c1281783063091519535' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/prosecution-as-persecution-carol-asher.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7523002643329887664' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7523002643329887664' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-748782271"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 27, 2012 at 1:32 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-962633003307448564</id><published>2012-12-27T12:41:11.263-07:00</published><updated>2012-12-27T12:41:11.263-07:00</updated><title type='text'>The contrast between the questions a statist expec...</title><content type='html'>The contrast between the questions a statist expects you &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;1)not to ask him, &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;and&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;2)you to think of and answer for him (even though he never thought to ask them)&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;sums the critters up.&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7523002643329887664/comments/default/962633003307448564'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7523002643329887664/comments/default/962633003307448564'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/prosecution-as-persecution-carol-asher.html?showComment=1356637271263#c962633003307448564' title=''/><author><name>Luton Ian</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/prosecution-as-persecution-carol-asher.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7523002643329887664' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7523002643329887664' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-391784771"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 27, 2012 at 12:41 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3473508429682014595</id><published>2012-12-27T03:50:34.771-07:00</published><updated>2012-12-27T03:50:34.771-07:00</updated><title type='text'>First of all the very act of being forced to atten...</title><content type='html'>First of all the very act of being forced to attend &amp;quot;jury duty&amp;quot; irks me to no end.  I&amp;#39;ve been on a murder trial and also a drugs and rape trial both times as the lucky &amp;quot;juror number 12&amp;quot;.  The second trial was a farce that involved a man who&amp;#39;d already spent time in the big house for a charge of forcible rape and drugs possession.  That one seemed to mutate before my very eyes to the point I no longer knew why I was there.  And to get twelve altogether unhappy people to agree on anything is like herding cats.  To this day I knew that one was screwed up and I only wish I knew then what I know today and I&amp;#39;d have voted against the boilerplate lies that were fed to me.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7523002643329887664/comments/default/3473508429682014595'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7523002643329887664/comments/default/3473508429682014595'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/prosecution-as-persecution-carol-asher.html?showComment=1356605434771#c3473508429682014595' title=''/><author><name>MoT</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/prosecution-as-persecution-carol-asher.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7523002643329887664' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7523002643329887664' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-610080049"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 27, 2012 at 3:50 AM"/></entry></feed>